{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceships and Cellular Automata is a tower defense game set in SPAAACE!!! It is brought to you by the creator of Cellka. Try to keep your crew safe from aliens on your quest to find a habitable exoplanet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/da0e7dcfa70facdf859e4ac95ddb76d1.poster.avif?t=1767241783\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/da0e7dcfa70facdf859e4ac95ddb76d1.webm?t=1767241783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/da0e7dcfa70facdf859e4ac95ddb76d1.mp4?t=1767241783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of simulated alien enemies based on John Conway's famous cellular automata Game of Life. They are simulated in real time and just a pixel from one of your towers is enough to set off a destabilizing chain reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/0f28f0b0ba06cb5250cd77695979a78b.poster.avif?t=1767241783\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/0f28f0b0ba06cb5250cd77695979a78b.webm?t=1767241783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/0f28f0b0ba06cb5250cd77695979a78b.mp4?t=1767241783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a number of different towers to choose from, each with their own corresponding character and way of completely obliterating your enemies. All towers can be upgraded to become bigger, stronger, and cause move havoc!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901540?t=1767241783","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901540?t=1767241783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/61170a32472a2494f53527bdceef170c72c18a76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767241783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/61170a32472a2494f53527bdceef170c72c18a76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767241783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceships and Cellular Automata is a tower defense game set in SPAAACE!!! It is brought to you by the creator of Cellka. Try to keep your crew safe from aliens on your quest to find a habitable exoplanet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/da0e7dcfa70facdf859e4ac95ddb76d1.poster.avif?t=1767241783\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/da0e7dcfa70facdf859e4ac95ddb76d1.webm?t=1767241783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901540/extras/da0e7dcfa70facdf859e4ac95ddb76d1.mp4?t=1767241783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of simulated alien enemies based on John Conway's famous cellular automata Game of Life. They are simulated in real time 